1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,050
How was your day?

2
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,050
Fine.

3
00:00:07,695 --> 00:00:11,175
Ken, you have four minutes left.

4
00:00:11,605 --> 00:00:12,705
What's this?

5
00:00:12,795 --> 00:00:13,755
Four minutes?

6
00:00:13,765 --> 00:00:15,855
Dinner will be ready by then.

7
00:00:16,025 --> 00:00:17,775
No, that's not...

8
00:00:25,805 --> 00:00:27,575
Cancel this.

9
00:00:27,645 --> 00:00:30,055
You can turn notifications off.

10
00:00:30,595 --> 00:00:32,055
Not the notification.

11
00:00:37,365 --> 00:00:38,195
Mom.

12
00:00:38,235 --> 00:00:39,125
Hmm?

13
00:00:39,995 --> 00:00:41,575
I... I only have...

14
00:00:41,995 --> 00:00:43,525
What's wrong?

15
00:00:46,315 --> 00:00:47,625
Nothing.

16
00:00:56,658 --> 00:00:59,258
While you're there,
get the plates.

17
00:00:59,498 --> 00:01:01,268
Not now. I don't have time.

18
00:01:01,458 --> 00:01:03,638
That's what you always say.

19
00:01:04,208 --> 00:01:05,378
Ken?

20
00:01:10,728 --> 00:01:11,928
Come here.

21
00:01:15,758 --> 00:01:16,938
Just leave it.

22
00:01:22,778 --> 00:01:24,438
How was your day?

23
00:01:25,008 --> 00:01:26,158
Ken?

24
00:01:26,768 --> 00:01:30,458
Mom. Look at this.

25
00:01:42,022 --> 00:01:44,342
Final notice...

26
00:01:47,592 --> 00:01:49,192
Yours?

27
00:01:52,145 --> 00:01:53,075
Yes.

28
00:01:56,575 --> 00:01:58,775
No. But... you're...

29
00:02:00,875 --> 00:02:03,225
Can't you stop it?

30
00:02:05,165 --> 00:02:07,125
It says I can't change it.

31
00:02:20,875 --> 00:02:23,725
Mom. Stay with me.

32
00:02:27,978 --> 00:02:29,008
Yes.

33
00:02:34,938 --> 00:02:36,258
Let's sit down.

34
00:02:50,478 --> 00:02:53,008
Yes. I'm listening.

35
00:02:55,058 --> 00:02:59,408
I just... need to say this right.

36
00:03:01,658 --> 00:03:04,758
At a time like this,
I should...

37
00:03:09,882 --> 00:03:12,592
You don't have to find
the right words.

38
00:03:16,462 --> 00:03:17,942
I'm scared.

39
00:03:20,442 --> 00:03:21,392
Yes.

40
00:03:26,492 --> 00:03:28,242
I'm here.

41
00:03:37,405 --> 00:03:38,795
Thank you.

42
00:03:41,705 --> 00:03:42,745
Yes.

43
00:03:43,045 --> 00:03:45,175
I heard you.

44
00:04:06,325 --> 00:04:07,255
Ken?
